	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c01r0501_trainerm_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おお！　やっぱり！？▼
なんだか　キミに　いわれると
いちだんと　じしんが　もてるよ！▼
ふゆう　ポケモンに
くろいてっきゅう　を　わたせば▽
じめんタイプの　わざも　あたる！▼
ありがとう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T11:58:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T11:57:35" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おお！　やっぱり！？▼
なんだか　キミに　いわれると
一段と　自信が　持てるよ！▼
ふゆう　ポケモンに
くろいてっきゅう　を　渡せば▽
じめんタイプの　技も　当たる！▼
ありがとう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T03:46:04" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T12:18:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・1問め正解
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T12:10:02" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>TRAINERM</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T11:56:05" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c01r0501_trainerm_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>また　キミの　ちえを
かして　ほしいんだ！▽
おねがい　できるかな？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T12:08:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T11:57:35" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>また　キミの　知恵を
貸して　ほしいんだ！▽
お願い　できるかな？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T03:46:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T12:18:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
　はい　→trainerm_07（1問正解時）
　　　　　→trainerm_11（２問正解時）
　いいえ→trainerm_03
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T12:12:59" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>TRAINERM</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T11:56:05" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
