	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c01r0501_trainerm_16"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さあ！　ボクの　むてきの
ふゆう　ポケモンと　たたかうかい？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T12:17:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T12:03:01" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>さあ！　ボクの　無敵の
ふゆう　ポケモンと　戦うかい？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T03:54:30" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
